      "content": "i get that but calling it \"highly dangerous\" sounds a bit extreme... i've read online that most people take them together just fine if they take small amounts. if i just took like a very low dose, maybe half of what the bottle says, wouldn't that be fine? i'm just looking for something to help me feel better without having to wait weeks for a doctor appointment.",
